      "note": "v38 (user 15.11.2026, all profiles): L1 on the bottom plate / R1 on the top one - the selector hits the mechanism's end stop: a dull heavy thud with a small rebound in the hand of the pressed button (R1 right, L1 left), instead of the light input contact."
